OL,3,GNEWSAGrand National winner continues to
OL,4,Achampion cancer research
OL,5,
OL,6,FChampion told BBC Look East: "I'm not
OL,7,Fsaying we are going to cure all cancers
OL,8,Fbut we are prolonging people's lives in
OL,9,Fa better way and hopefully one day we
OL,10,Fwill eradicate cancer in some sort of
OL,11,Fway."
